 A User's Guide</source><year>1996</year><publisher-name>United Kingdom: European Research Group on Health Outcomes</publisher-name><fpage>12</fpage><lpage>26</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Carunungan-Robles</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Perception of parental nurturance, punitiveness and power by selected Filipino primary school children</article-title><source>Philippine Journal of Psychology</source><year>1986</year><volume>19</volume><fpage>18</fpage><lpage>28</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Crystal</surname><given-names>DP</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A correlational study of body image and perceived parental nurturance in college females</article-title><source>PhD thesis</source><year>2002</year><publisher-name>Wisconsin Lutheran College, Department of Psychology</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Starrels</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Gender differences in parent-child relations</article-title><source>Journal of Family Issues</source><year>1994</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>148</fpage><lpage>165</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>